-\textbf{CAD-to-Mesh Automation Algorithm}\par
-\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=1.4em,topsep=1pt,itemsep=1pt]
-\item Developed a CAD-to-mesh automation algorithm for engineering simulation preprocessing, applying computational geometry methods with an emphasis on reducing arithmetic complexity and automating mesh generation from CAD models.
-\end{itemize}
